     1146   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF TOG-1,TOG-17, TOG-2, TOG-18 ,TOG-3, TOG-19, TOG-4, TOG-20, TOG-5, TOG-21, TOG-22, TOG-6, TOG-7, TOG-8, TOG-9, TOG-10, TOG-11, TOG-12, TOG-13, TOG-14, TOG-15, TOG-16 ,TOG-23, TOG-24, TOG-25, TOG-26, TOG-27, TOG-28
