     1367   PROCEDURE Show-format :
     1368   define variable  ij as integer no-undo .
     1369   run eq-frame.
     1370   col-size = 0.
     1371   repeat ij = 1 to 28 :
     1372    if use-column[ij] then col-size = col-size + s-column[ij] + 1 .
     1373   End.
     1374    F-col-size:screen-value in frame Dialog-Frame = string(col-size).
     1375    F-col-size = string(col-size).
     1376    Display F-col-size with frame Dialog-Frame.
     1377   If col-size >= 0 and col-size <= 139 Then DO:
     1378     Display
     1379     RECT-13 A4-port a-3
     1380        with frame Dialog-Frame.
     1381     Hide
     1382     RECT-14 a4-lansc
     1383     RECT-15 a3
     1384     only-file
     1385     only-text-exel
     1386     in frame Dialog-Frame.
     1387     print-o = "A4-port":U.
     1388   End.
     1389   If col-size > 139 and col-size <= 198 Then DO:
     1390     Display
     1391     RECT-14 a4-lansc a-3
     1392        with frame Dialog-Frame.
     1393     Hide
     1394     RECT-13 A4-port
     1395     RECT-15 a3
